-- ============================================================================
-- DR3 PROFESSIONAL DEEP SEED: Drilling Hydraulics, intermediate tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json.
--
-- What this tier owns: the annulus, which is carrying cuttings and pressing on
-- the formation at the same time. Only the annulus loss reaches the rock,
-- because the pipe and the bit are inside the string; the equivalent
-- circulating density divides by TRUE VERTICAL depth, which is why a lateral
-- raises it so sharply and why using measured depth is an error in the unsafe
-- direction; it is a PROFILE and the formation that fractures is not always
-- the deepest one; and cuttings are worth about 11.6 kg/m3 of bulk density per
-- percent by volume in this mud and are absent from the pressure calculation.
-- Annular velocity is flow rate over area, so the slowest place is the WIDEST
-- annulus, which is the shallowest; slip velocity is a falling particle solved
-- with Schiller-Naumann drag and it RISES where the annulus is tight because
-- the mud is sheared thinner there. Cleaning wants more flow and the formation
-- wants less, and on this well the PUMP binds first.
--
-- THE LIMITATION THIS TIER IS BUILT AROUND. The transport model has no
-- inclination term at all, and the engine's own output proves it: the
-- horizontal well and the slant well return identical transport ratios at
-- every flow rate. Cuttings beds above about 30 degrees are the dominant real
-- hole cleaning mechanism, they are moved by rotation first and flow rate
-- second, and neither rotation nor a bed exists in this model. The computed
-- transport ratio is an UPPER BOUND on a deviated well and the tier says so
-- rather than inventing an inclination correction with no oracle behind it.
--
-- Numeric sweep 200 literals / 0 unresolved over the lessons; tier-leakage 0
-- downward leaks and 0 same-tier answer prints over the lessons and the banks.
--
-- Answer keys live only here and in academy_quiz_questions.
-- ============================================================================

